<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.1.13.2.1"/>
    <code code="10154-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Chief complaint Narrative - Reported"/>
    <title>Chief Complaint</title>
    <text><paragraph>Fever, aching all over, and headache since yesterday, two days after a bone-strengthening infusion. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Ms. Lange is a 61-year-old photographer with post-polio syndrome and osteoporosis who had her first infusion of zoledronic acid 5 mg two days ago. Yesterday afternoon, about 24 hours after the infusion, she developed a temperature of 38.1 °C, aching in her thighs, shoulders, and knees, a dull headache, and tiredness. She has no cough, sore throat, burning on passing urine, rash, or diarrhea, and no numbness or tingling around the mouth or cramps in her hands. She took acetaminophen 1000 mg twice with partial relief and has been drinking well. She was worried that the aching meant her polio-affected muscles were getting worse, and asked whether she should cancel a field day next week. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Onset</td><td>About 24 hours after the first zoledronic acid infusion</td></tr><tr><td>Location</td><td>Thighs, shoulders, knees; headache</td></tr><tr><td>Duration</td><td>One day</td></tr><tr><td>Character</td><td>Flu-like aching with low-grade fever</td></tr><tr><td>Severity</td><td>Moderate; resting at home</td></tr><tr><td>Context</td><td>First intravenous bisphosphonate dose; vitamin D replete before it</td></tr><tr><td>Modifying factors</td><td>Acetaminophen helps partly</td></tr><tr><td>Associated signs and symptoms</td><td>No cough, urinary symptoms, rash, or symptoms of low calcium</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

