    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Fever to 38.1 °C and tiredness; no rigors</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Diffuse muscle and joint aching, not focal; no new weakness</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Positive</td><td>Mild headache; no stiff neck, no tingling around the mouth or hand cramps</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough or breathlessness</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No burning or frequency</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Negative</td><td>No eye pain or redness</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>6 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
